Summary of Modifications (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b))
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Kestrel customizes and extends upstream Herdr (herdr-app) with:
- Kestrel desktop application branding, custom macOS .app bundle/icons, and
  isolated `~/.config/kestrel` app home with automatic migration from
  `~/.config/herdr-app` and `kestrel` / `kc` CLI aliases.
- Outbound telemetry, feedback, update polling, and remote release-notes media
  fetching disabled by default in local builds.
- Google Antigravity (`agy`) & Vertex AI integration (`Settings -> Vertex AI`,
  ADC / service-account environment injection, Model Garden presets, execution
  mode cycling).
- Multi-Agent Fleet Board (`defaults/mods/board`) and upgraded Agents sidebar
  (`defaults/mods/agents`) with Central Pending Approvals supporting both
  foreground confirmations (`Enter` / `a` / `Esc`) and Antigravity swarm
  subagent approvals (`Ctrl+K` / `^K`).
- Persistent Agent Session Recovery across macOS reboots (`savedSessions` &
  `autoRestoreSessions` with 1-click `Restore All` / `agy -c` / `claude --continue`).
- Artifacts, Rich Markdown & 2D Vector SVG Mermaid Studio (`defaults/mods/brain`
  & `defaults/mods/files/doc-render.js`) rendering Antigravity artifacts, GitHub
  callouts, carousels, images, side-by-side split previews, and 6 Mermaid diagram
  types (`flowchart`/`graph`, `sequenceDiagram`, `stateDiagram-v2`, `classDiagram`,
  `erDiagram`, `xychart-beta`).
- Window-adaptive Top Bar & searchable Cross-Space Running Agents overflow
  dropdown (`defaults/mods/tabs` & `defaults/mods/terminals-bar`).

